2026150,definition secondary trauma,msmarco_passage_48_74457453,3,द्वितीयक आघात की परिभाषा,"Secondary trauma is a traumatized reaction to another person’s experience. It can happen suddenly, after a single exposure. Vicarious trauma happens when a द्वितीयक आघात की परिभाषा person is exposed to the trauma of others on an ongoing basis. Over time, both secondary and vicarious trauma can cause compassion fatigue.",3
2026150,definition secondary trauma,msmarco_passage_03_717625266,3,द्वितीयक आघात की परिभाषा,"SECONDARY TRAUMA. People at risk for secondary traumatization are those other than the actual victims who are affected by the traumatic event. This may include friends, family and acquaintances of the victim, or people who have simply heard about the trauma or crisis. People who help trauma and crisis victims are द्वितीयक आघात की परिभाषा sometimes at risk for secondary trauma as well.",2
